WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.760
Buying your first home can feel like a big step.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:10.640
It often begins before you have even found the right property.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.320
We're here to help you with that journey.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.600
An adviser can help you understand what you may be able to borrow.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.920
Based on your individual circumstances and lender criteria.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:25.500
You can start your journey in your own time using our customer portal.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.140
Or book a conversation when you are ready.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:35.580
This helps your adviser understand your situation earlier — so they can focus on what matters most.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:41.480
When choosing a mortgage, your adviser will help you explore options that may suit your circumstances.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.960
They can also help you prepare for the next steps.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:49.880
When the time is right, your adviser can provide an Agreement in Principle.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.780
Although this is not a mortgage offer.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:56.720
It can help you move forward with more clarity when you are ready to make an offer.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:03.400
From your initial application to completion, your adviser works with your conveyancer and estate agent.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:07.910
And when you finally open the door to your new home, it is your moment.

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:09.530
Your journey.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:10.970
Made clearer.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:14.330
Understand what you may be able to borrow.

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:17.070
Explore mortgage options with an adviser.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:19.750
Get your Agreement in Principle.

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.250
Make your offer when you are ready.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:24.910
Move in — and talk about protecting what matters.
